01:34.657 --> 01:36.327
A cursed cockatiel?!

01:36.327 --> 01:38.287
Well, about that...

01:38.287 --> 01:42.117
I heard everyone who owned it died horrible deaths.

01:42.117 --> 01:43.377
Seriously?!

01:43.377 --> 01:44.837
That's freaky.

01:46.257 --> 01:47.797
Shigeo, you want it?

01:48.257 --> 01:51.257
After hearing that? HELL NO.

01:51.757 --> 01:54.267
Why didn't you get rid of it already?

01:54.547 --> 01:56.887
Because I, like, feel sorry for it.

01:56.887 --> 01:58.097
How about you, Chad-san?

01:58.097 --> 01:59.517
It's cute.

02:01.227 --> 02:02.607
You dumbass, quit that.

02:02.607 --> 02:04.687
Chad has a soft spot for cute things.

02:08.987 --> 02:09.697
What?

02:20.997 --> 02:23.957
We shall continue to consume.

02:24.647 --> 02:31.547
To fill the emptiness of our existence,
we must continue to consume.

02:32.257 --> 02:37.557
The soul of a Shinigami...  It is exceptionally delectable.

02:37.557 --> 02:42.727
Once one has known the taste, one
inevitably becomes captive to it.

02:55.367 --> 02:56.327
Chad-san...

02:58.367 --> 03:00.037
You okay, Chad?

03:00.537 --> 03:01.287
Yeah.

03:01.917 --> 03:03.087
It's nothing.

03:03.747 --> 03:05.367
"It's nothing"?!

03:05.367 --> 03:06.837
You're bleeding!

03:07.417 --> 03:09.797
Thank you for saving me.

03:10.257 --> 03:13.087
My name is Shibata Yuuichi.

03:13.087 --> 03:14.757
What is your name, Mister?

03:15.547 --> 03:17.307
What's with this bird?!

03:17.307 --> 03:19.557
It's like it knows what's going on.

03:19.557 --> 03:21.977
It really must be a cursed cockatiel.

03:21.977 --> 03:23.727
What's your name, Mister?

03:25.807 --> 03:27.897
Sado Yasutora.

03:28.857 --> 03:30.567
I'm only 15.

03:30.567 --> 03:31.647
Oh, crap!

03:31.647 --> 03:33.697
Chad's fascinated by it!

03:36.737 --> 03:38.507
Man...

03:38.507 --> 03:42.117
I can't believe my injury healed in a day.

03:42.117 --> 03:43.577
Surprised?

03:43.577 --> 03:46.977
My grades in demon magic were in the top level.

03:46.977 --> 03:49.127
Healing like that's a piece of cake.

03:49.127 --> 03:50.127
Grades?

03:50.437 --> 03:51.127
So what?

03:51.797 --> 03:53.637
Shinigamis have a school?

03:54.387 --> 03:55.597
Well, yeah.

03:55.597 --> 03:57.097
More importantly, Ichigo...

03:57.757 --> 03:59.557
...how does one drink this?

04:00.927 --> 04:02.117
"How"?

04:02.117 --> 04:04.187
You poke the straw in and drink it, obviously.

04:04.667 --> 04:05.517
The straw?

04:07.247 --> 04:08.067
Oh?

04:08.067 --> 04:09.277
You're together again.

04:10.567 --> 04:12.527
You two are awfully friendly,

04:12.987 --> 04:14.027
Mizuiro.

04:14.737 --> 04:17.987
You moron, does this look like friends?

04:19.157 --> 04:20.157
You're not?

04:20.827 --> 04:23.577
Well, if you want to deny it, that's okay, too.

04:24.117 --> 04:28.627
I'm not sure how to say this, but you should consider
what others think a bit more, Ichigo.

04:28.627 --> 04:30.167
You stupid?

04:30.167 --> 04:34.587
If I cared about that, I'd have dyed my hair black years ago.

04:34.587 --> 04:35.927
That's true.

04:35.927 --> 04:37.427
Oh, so this is it?!

04:38.637 --> 04:42.017
But... where should I poke it...

04:43.177 --> 04:44.897
Kuchiki-san, hello.

04:45.887 --> 04:49.267
Hello, uh... Kojima-kun.

04:50.017 --> 04:51.337
Right.

04:51.337 --> 04:53.527
I still haven't introduced myself, have I?

04:53.937 --> 04:55.597
Kojima Mizuiro, 15 years old.

04:55.597 --> 04:56.247
My hobby is...

04:56.247 --> 04:57.257
...girl hunting.

04:57.257 --> 04:57.907
What?!

04:57.907 --> 04:58.707
No, it's not!

04:58.707 --> 04:59.907
That's mean.

04:59.907 --> 05:02.617
He looks innocent, but he's an incurable womanizer.

05:02.617 --> 05:03.747
Be careful.

05:03.747 --> 05:05.147
Quit that!

05:05.147 --> 05:07.207
You'll ruin my image!?

05:07.707 --> 05:10.977
Besides, I'm only interested in older women.

05:10.977 --> 05:13.177
That's why I told her to be careful.

05:13.177 --> 05:13.667
Huh?

