Nothing.

05:18.667 --> 05:19.467
Hark!

05:19.857 --> 05:22.877
Lo there do I see our pretty new
transfer student, Kuchiki-san!

05:22.877 --> 05:23.977
Why art thou here?

05:24.517 --> 05:26.967
Ichigo hit on her and lured her up here.

05:26.967 --> 05:27.727
Wha-  No-

05:27.727 --> 05:28.807
What?!

05:28.807 --> 05:29.937
Ichigo, you bastard!

05:30.347 --> 05:31.777
Good job!

05:32.727 --> 05:34.947
Oh... You're happy enough to cry?

05:37.147 --> 05:41.567
Thank you, Captain, for coming to
this squalid garden of manliness!

05:41.567 --> 05:42.657
Hello...

05:42.657 --> 05:43.827
Come on, everyone!

05:43.827 --> 05:46.117
Today's lunch will be a party! A huge party!

05:46.337 --> 05:48.207
With coffee milk and yakisoba bread?

05:48.207 --> 05:49.417
Shut up!

05:49.417 --> 05:51.087
It's the feeling that counts!

05:51.087 --> 05:55.467
Ah, yes, Kuchiki-san, if you need help
with anything at all, please ask me.

05:56.127 --> 05:57.167
Really?!

05:57.167 --> 05:59.547
Yes, of course.

05:59.927 --> 06:01.217
Hey, Chad.

06:03.347 --> 06:05.847
You're... injured.

06:06.387 --> 06:07.687
Whoa, its true.

06:07.687 --> 06:08.977
What happened?

06:08.977 --> 06:12.107
The one on my head is from a steel
girder that fell on me yesterday.

06:12.107 --> 06:14.107
A-A STEEL GIRDER?!

06:14.107 --> 06:18.487
The one on my hand and arm is from a
head-on collision with a motorcycle.

06:19.407 --> 06:25.287
The rider was hurt badly, so I carried him
to the hospital and just got back.

06:25.657 --> 06:27.507
So that's why you're late...

06:27.507 --> 06:31.037
More like, I'm still wondering what the heck you're made of?

06:32.497 --> 06:34.797
Hey, what's with the bird?

06:35.707 --> 06:39.547
Hello, my name is Shibata Yuichi.

06:39.547 --> 06:41.257
What is your name?

06:41.837 --> 06:44.057
Whoa! Amazing!

06:44.057 --> 06:45.807
This thing can seriously talk!

06:45.807 --> 06:48.267
My name is Asano Keigo

06:48.267 --> 06:49.017
Say it.

06:50.097 --> 06:52.767
Chad, where'd you get this cockatiel?

06:53.227 --> 06:54.187
Yesterday...

06:59.897 --> 07:01.027
...I got it.

07:01.027 --> 07:02.407
WAIT ONE MINUTE!

07:02.407 --> 07:05.907
You got lazy in the middle and shortened
the story just now, didn't you?!

07:06.267 --> 07:07.407
That's a bad habit.

07:07.407 --> 07:09.037
Tell us, tell us everything.

07:09.037 --> 07:10.077
I didn't shorten it.

07:10.077 --> 07:11.957
No, you did!

07:12.327 --> 07:13.617
You know...

07:13.617 --> 07:14.917
Don't worry.

07:15.667 --> 07:18.217
There certainly is something inside it, but...

07:18.217 --> 07:19.627
...it's nothing bad.

07:20.217 --> 07:22.427
It's probably just a lonely ghost.

07:23.087 --> 07:25.967
We can't just let it be, though.

07:27.427 --> 07:31.057
Sometime tonight, we should give it a soul burial.

07:31.727 --> 07:33.037
Roger.

07:33.037 --> 07:35.687
I'm gonna miss out on sleep again.

07:36.267 --> 07:37.737
Don't complain.

07:38.107 --> 07:39.527
Sure, sure.

07:40.687 --> 07:45.277
But... he immediately began to worry about
others at just the hint of a ghost.

07:45.277 --> 07:49.597
I suppose he is finally learning the mindset of a Shinigami.

07:49.597 --> 07:50.537
Here.

07:51.657 --> 07:52.627
Thank you.

07:54.037 --> 07:55.337
When I was in eighth grade...

07:56.837 --> 07:58.587
...was when I first met Chad.

08:01.377 --> 08:05.367
Back then, because of my hair, people had it out for me.

08:05.927 --> 08:07.467
I got into fights all the time.

08:08.557 --> 08:11.767
Then one time, things started to get really serious.

08:25.777 --> 08:27.367
Who the hell are you?!?

08:38.207 --> 08:39.417
DIE!

08:57.857 --> 09:00.397
Chad won't fight no matter how tangled up he gets.

09:02.237 --> 09:03.537
That's unusual.

09:03.537 --> 09:04.317
Yeah.

09:06.857 --> 09:08.277
This juice is good!

09:08.737 --> 09:09.737
Oh.

09:15.747 --> 09:16.927
I'm home.

09:16.927 --> 09:18.667
Out of the way! Out of the way!

09:20.127 --> 09:21.227
What's wrong, Karin?

09:21.227 --> 09:22.337
What're you rushing-

09:23.587 --> 09:25.217
Onii-chan, welcome home.

09:25.967 --> 09:27.927
What's all this ruckus?!

09:27.927 --> 09:30.887
There was a traffic accident at a nearby intersection.

09:31.277 --> 09:32.757
A traffic accident?

09:32.757 --> 09:34.347
You can't take them?!

09:34.347 --> 09:35.707
Do it anyways!

09:35.707 --> 09:38.987
We've got patients we're not fully equipped to treat!

09:38.987 --> 09:43.267
Listen, tell your chief of staff it's a request from Kurosaki!

09:43.267 --> 09:46.237
Then you'll have as many open beds as you want!

09:46.857 --> 09:47.857
Got it?!

09:49.277 --> 09:50.197
Pop.

09:50.867 --> 09:53.687
Dammit, freaking underlings dragging their feet!

09:53.687 --> 09:55.687
Anything I can help with?

09:55.307 --> 09:56.377
Nothing!

09:57.417 --> 09:59.877
Go hide in the corner so you don't get in my way!

10:04.747 --> 10:07.007
Dad, here's another.

10:08.727 --> 10:11.257
That's a big one we got here.

10:11.257 --> 10:13.427
Ichigo, time to work.

10:13.887 --> 10:14.517
Okay.

10:17.557 --> 10:18.437
Chad!

10:35.697 --> 10:36.827
What a horrible wound.

10:36.827 --> 10:38.837
This is pretty bad.

10:39.367 --> 10:41.457
It seems like a burn.

10:41.457 --> 10:42.837
What could've hit you?

10:42.837 --> 10:44.087
This feeling...

10:44.707 --> 10:47.017
You'll have to take it easy for-

10:47.017 --> 10:47.757
No.

10:49.677 --> 10:51.507
I'm fine now.

10:52.387 --> 10:53.467
Yeah, right!

10:53.467 --> 10:55.967
No way you're fine with all that bleeding.

10:58.677 --> 10:59.847
See, I told you so.

11:00.267 --> 11:01.587
Yuzu, Karin!

11:01.587 --> 11:02.807
Prepare a bed.

11:02.807 --> 11:03.647
Okay!

11:03.647 --> 11:06.147
Be good and go to bed, okay?

11:09.317 --> 11:10.277
Did you feel it?

11:10.737 --> 11:11.907
Of course.

11:11.907 --> 11:13.777
I noticed it even from here.

11:14.867 --> 11:17.207
I didn't feel anything from the cockatiel.

11:17.207 --> 11:18.447
From his wound, though...

11:20.117 --> 11:21.667
...I smelled a Hollow's scent.

11:58.927 --> 12:00.057
Good morning!

12:00.057 --> 12:02.497
Onii-chan, breakfast time.

12:02.497 --> 12:03.517
Huh?

12:03.517 --> 12:04.837
Where's Karin?

12:04.837 --> 12:06.457
She said she doesn't want any.

12:07.057 --> 12:09.757
Seems like she's not feeling well.

12:10.427 --> 12:12.177
She's not feeling well?

12:12.727 --> 12:14.347
Guess there's a first for everyth-

12:14.027 --> 12:15.177
ICHIGO!

12:15.177 --> 12:16.107
There's trouble!

12:16.107 --> 12:17.757
Chad-kun's disappeared from his room!

12:22.737 --> 12:23.557
Ichigo!

12:25.247 --> 12:26.017
Rukia!

12:26.867 --> 12:28.977
How's it going? Have you picked up the trail?

12:28.977 --> 12:30.887
No, how about you?

12:30.887 --> 12:31.947
I've got nothing, too.

12:32.417 --> 12:35.397
Zero info from Soul Society about the Hollow.

12:35.397 --> 12:36.777
And nothing on the radar.

