Understand?

12:54.037 --> 12:56.137
With your crappy drawings,
the comprehensible becomes incom-

12:57.517 --> 13:00.997
Chad's... being stalked by a Hollow.

13:00.997 --> 13:03.927
If we wait until he's attacked to act, it'll be too late!

13:04.257 --> 13:05.517
Somehow...

13:07.327 --> 13:07.997
That's it!

13:07.997 --> 13:09.567
The cockatiel Chad was carrying...

13:10.037 --> 13:12.777
...we can just follow the ghost that was possessing it.

13:13.457 --> 13:14.527
That's impossible!

13:14.527 --> 13:15.907
Here goes...

13:29.307 --> 13:31.007
Ichi-nii...go...

13:31.557 --> 13:33.707
What... is this feeling?

13:42.987 --> 13:44.077
Mister.

13:44.077 --> 13:45.937
Mister, you're a good person.

13:46.617 --> 13:50.357
Mister, I have to apologize.

13:50.917 --> 13:55.147
The truth is... the people who own me all meet misfortune.

13:55.837 --> 13:56.487
Yeah.

13:57.257 --> 13:58.107
I know.

14:00.547 --> 14:02.997
I'm sorry for not telling you.

14:03.427 --> 14:04.007
I...

14:04.007 --> 14:05.077
Don't worry about it.

14:05.387 --> 14:09.347
Mister, don't worry about me anymore...

14:09.347 --> 14:10.037
Leave me.

14:12.597 --> 14:13.547
Mister.

14:14.017 --> 14:15.297
I can't do that.

14:24.947 --> 14:26.137
Ichi-nii...

14:31.327 --> 14:32.897
I have to tell him...

14:34.417 --> 14:35.227
It can't be.

14:35.227 --> 14:36.147
It's impossible.

14:36.837 --> 14:40.337
Even I can't sense such a weak ghost.

14:41.087 --> 14:43.447
Then to follow it from so far away...

14:51.417 --> 14:52.627
This is...

14:52.627 --> 14:53.627
I found it!

14:54.727 --> 14:55.587
This one.

14:59.467 --> 15:01.717
Just now, was that... spirit threads?

15:02.187 --> 15:03.827
Visualized spirit energy...

15:03.827 --> 15:06.347
Only top Shinigami should be able to see them...

15:06.347 --> 15:10.437
He's... already grown so much in such a short time?!

15:12.747 --> 15:14.397
I think we're safe now.

15:14.397 --> 15:17.187
Mister, it's okay, you can go.

15:17.187 --> 15:19.277
Don't worry, I'm fine.

15:20.457 --> 15:23.117
Being sturdy is my only worth, anyway.

15:31.717 --> 15:32.817
It found us.

15:32.817 --> 15:33.667
We're gonna escape.

15:33.667 --> 15:35.187
Mister...

15:35.187 --> 15:37.207
Don't worry, I'm fine.

15:45.567 --> 15:46.267
There he is!

15:47.237 --> 15:48.057
It's Chad.

15:51.907 --> 15:54.147
You dumbass, why are you running away?

15:54.147 --> 15:55.577
You're in danger if you're alone!

15:55.577 --> 15:56.607
Ichi-nii!

15:58.577 --> 15:59.317
Karin?!

15:59.747 --> 16:02.027
What's wrong? You look like you can barely stand.

16:04.027 --> 16:04.817
Karin!

16:05.967 --> 16:06.617
Ichigo!

16:07.337 --> 16:09.827
You take her home first.

16:10.717 --> 16:12.367
I'll go to save him.

16:13.677 --> 16:14.787
What are you talking about?!

16:14.787 --> 16:16.167
I can't ask you to...

16:16.167 --> 16:17.707
Don't argue.

16:18.597 --> 16:25.387
I can't have your concentration break in the middle
of fighting the Hollow because you left her here.

16:27.787 --> 16:29.507
Get going already.

16:29.507 --> 16:30.427
Okay?

16:31.887 --> 16:32.937
Rukia.

16:34.467 --> 16:38.857
You... still haven’t regained the strength
to fight a Hollow, have you?

16:41.157 --> 16:43.157
Don't try to be a hero.

16:43.547 --> 16:44.447
Fool.

16:45.337 --> 16:49.237
I would never slip up bad enough for you to worry.

16:51.847 --> 16:52.867
See you.

16:53.607 --> 16:54.377
Yeah!

16:58.347 --> 16:59.717
You okay, Karin.

16:59.717 --> 17:00.747
Hold on!

17:00.747 --> 17:02.047
This isn't like you.

17:02.607 --> 17:03.717
Ichi-nii...

17:04.107 --> 17:06.637
I saw it...

17:06.637 --> 17:09.557
...the memory of the ghost that was possessing that cockatiel.

17:10.107 --> 17:13.267
I think it's because I was the closest in age.

17:14.077 --> 17:20.427
The strongest memory in that boy's mind flowed into me.

17:21.357 --> 17:24.107
Right before... his eyes...

17:24.627 --> 17:27.077
Before his eyes, his mom was murdered.

17:28.297 --> 17:30.367
Please, Ichi-nii...

17:31.967 --> 17:34.577
Please, that boy...

17:36.097 --> 17:37.377
Save him...

17:38.177 --> 17:39.167
I beg you.

17:43.517 --> 17:45.087
Damn, I can't catch up.

17:45.607 --> 17:49.307
If only I wasn't in this faux body, this would be nothing.

17:49.697 --> 17:53.827
Why the hell should a faux body's physical
ability be the same as an ordinary human's?

17:54.307 --> 17:56.897
Those damn quacks in the demon craft development bureau.

17:57.247 --> 17:58.097
This is bad.

17:58.097 --> 17:59.767
My breath is getting much heavier.

18:01.707 --> 18:03.727
I smell something good.

18:22.497 --> 18:25.667
You smell really tasty.

18:26.357 --> 18:28.297
Let me have a taste...

18:29.017 --> 18:30.687
...of your soul!

18:34.197 --> 18:36.477
You don't die from one hit?

18:36.477 --> 18:41.357
And it seems like you can see me, too.

18:41.357 --> 18:42.857
Who the he-

18:48.917 --> 18:49.817
O Lord...

18:50.587 --> 18:54.497
...Mask of Flesh and Bone, All Creation, Flutter
of Wings, Ye who bears the name of Man...

18:55.047 --> 18:56.327
...Truth and Temperance...

18:56.327 --> 18:59.287
Upon this sinless wall of dreams unleash
but slightly the wrath of your claws.

19:00.017 --> 19:01.327
Way of Destruction, number 33...

19:01.327 --> 19:02.707
SOUKATSUI!

19:05.937 --> 19:06.667
It worked...

19:07.267 --> 19:09.507
Good, at least I have some powe-

19:15.447 --> 19:16.977
What was that sound?

19:17.577 --> 19:19.017
She's being attacked.

19:19.577 --> 19:25.937
That girl who was chasing us is being
attacked by the one who attacked us.

19:28.127 --> 19:28.897
You...

19:29.107 --> 19:30.027
...stay here.

19:30.417 --> 19:31.407
What are you gonna do?

19:31.957 --> 19:32.947
I'm going to save her.

19:33.497 --> 19:34.967
You can't, Mister!

19:34.967 --> 19:36.077
It's dangerous!

19:40.707 --> 19:42.327
That's not what I meant.

19:42.327 --> 19:48.387
I didn't mean if you left me in the road, I'd
get hit by a car or something like that...

19:48.387 --> 19:50.147
Ah, no, Mister!

19:50.147 --> 19:51.897
You can't see ghosts.

19:51.897 --> 19:52.687
Don't go!

19:52.687 --> 19:54.397
That thing will get you!

19:54.397 --> 19:55.177
Wait!

19:55.177 --> 19:56.177
Mister!

19:56.567 --> 19:58.137
Mister!

19:59.527 --> 20:00.347
It can't be.

20:00.347 --> 20:01.477
It's unharmed?

20:03.197 --> 20:05.187
I know that spell.

20:05.187 --> 20:06.857
It's a Shinigami's spell.

20:06.857 --> 20:08.147
Isn't it?

20:08.147 --> 20:10.947
But yours is so weak.

20:10.947 --> 20:12.277
It didn't hurt a bit.

20:13.947 --> 20:14.817
Damn!

20:14.817 --> 20:18.947
So I still haven't recovered enough
to use that level of demon magic.

20:19.177 --> 20:20.507
I see.

20:20.507 --> 20:22.917
So you were a Shinigami?

20:22.917 --> 20:26.417
No wonder you smell so tasty.

20:27.687 --> 20:29.267
A Shinigami, eh?

20:29.267 --> 20:30.877
I sure lucked out.

20:31.417 --> 20:38.887
You know, I've eaten two Shinigami who
came to send that kid to heaven.

20:40.907 --> 20:43.437
They tasted so damn good.

20:44.947 --> 20:48.357
"That kid" as in the ghost inside the cockatiel?

20:48.577 --> 20:49.957
That's right.

20:49.957 --> 20:53.817
Apparently, you've been stubbornly
chasing that ghost around.

20:53.817 --> 20:54.527
Why?!

20:54.527 --> 20:56.257
Let's see now...

20:56.257 --> 21:01.177
If you behave and let me eat you, I'll answer.

21:01.177 --> 21:02.287
You scum...

21:11.517 --> 21:12.587
Karin...

21:14.897 --> 21:16.347
Tell him...

21:16.937 --> 21:19.637
...that if he goes to the other side, he can see his mom again.

21:19.637 --> 21:21.517
Tell the boy that.

21:22.577 --> 21:25.807
Don't let him be alone anymore.

21:26.497 --> 21:29.017
Please, Ichi-nii...

