22:35.857 --> 22:38.557
Shinigamis often go to the mysterious Urahara store.

22:38.557 --> 22:41.257
The scent of danger surrounds the
shop owner, Urahara Kisuke-dono.

22:41.257 --> 22:44.737
Then a certain object taken from
the store will invite new tragedy.

22:44.737 --> 22:46.577
That preview's a week early!

22:46.577 --> 22:48.157
It isn't even that dark of a story.

22:48.157 --> 22:49.557
Ah, I knew time would run out-
